PHREN=[['希腊 phrēn 心智；也指膈膜','古人对身体与心智的理解体现在同一组词里']]
FREN=PHREN+[['希腊 phrenitis、phrenitikos → 拉丁 phreneticus','古代描述谵妄、精神失常等的词族，不等同现代诊断']]
FRENETIC=FREN+[['古法语 frenetike → 中古英语 frenetik → frenetic','旧精神状态词逐渐发展出活动猛烈、忙乱的现代义']]
FRANTIC=FREN+[['古法语相关词 → 中古英语 frentik / frantike → frantic','中古英语变体形成这条短词形，后来常说焦急忙乱']]
FRENZY=FREN+[['拉丁 phreneticus → 回构 phrenesis → 中世纪拉丁 phrenesia','从相关形容词重新形成状态名词'],['古法语 frenesie → 英语 frenzy','从谵妄等旧义扩展为激动、狂热、忙乱']]
SCHIZ=PHREN+[['近代德语 Schizophrenie → 英语 schizophrenia','schizo- 分开 + phren- 心智；历史命名不等于多重人格']]
W=[
E('frantic','/ˈfræntɪk/','急得发慌的；忙乱的；拼命的','事情太急或太让人担心，人已经很难从容地一步步处理。','接中古英语 frentik、frantike 等变体，远源是希腊与拉丁的旧精神状态词族；与 frenetic 同源，不是从今天的 frenetic 随意删字母。',FRANTIC,'a frantic search 是焦急的搜寻；frantic with worry 是担心得发慌。它常带情绪和紧迫感，不只是客观上任务多。','a frantic search；frantic efforts；frantic with worry；a frantic phone call。','busy 只是忙；frantic 常是急、乱、慌。frenetic 更容易突出节奏和活动密度。',('We made a frantic search for the missing passport.','我们焦急地到处寻找丢失的护照。'),('She was frantic with worry when he failed to come home.','他没有回家，她担心得慌了神。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/frantic','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/frantic#English']),
E('frantically','/ˈfræntɪkli/','慌忙地；焦急地；拼命地','动作很急，背后往往有害怕、担心或迫在眉睫的压力。','frantic + -ally，符合许多 -ic 形容词的副词构成；常见读音不把拼写中的每个元音都单独念出来。',FRANTIC+[['英语 frantic + -ally → frantically','把焦急忙乱变成动作的方式']],'search frantically 是急得不停找；wave frantically 是拼命挥手。副词描述做事状态，不保证事情最终成功。','search frantically；wave frantically；work frantically；try frantically to do something。','quickly 只说速度快；frantically 还带迫切或慌乱的情绪。',('He searched frantically through every pocket.','他焦急地翻遍了每个口袋。'),('We waved frantically at the departing bus.','我们朝正在开走的公交车拼命挥手。'),sources=['https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/frantically','https://www.etymonline.com/word/frantic']),
E('frenzy','/ˈfrenzi/','狂热；一阵疯狂忙乱；激动失控的状态','像很多行动和情绪同时被点燃，人们一股脑地冲进去。','经古法语 frenesie 接中世纪拉丁 phrenesia、phrenesis；与拉丁 phreneticus 的回构关系相连，远源接希腊 phrēn 心智这一族。',FRENZY,'a buying frenzy 是抢购狂潮；a media frenzy 是媒体蜂拥报道的热潮；in a frenzy 是处于激动忙乱中。现代这些用法通常不是医学诊断。','a buying frenzy；a media frenzy；in a frenzy；a frenzy of activity。','excitement 可以很温和、愉快；frenzy 强调程度很高，常有失控或一窝蜂的感觉。',('The limited release triggered a buying frenzy online.','这次限量发售在网上引发了抢购狂潮。'),('The kitchen was a frenzy of activity before the guests arrived.','客人到来前，厨房里忙得不可开交。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/frenzy','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/frenzy#English']),
E('frenzied','/ˈfrenzid/','狂热的；疯狂忙乱的','用来形容已经被强烈兴奋或焦急带动起来的动作、活动或人群。','frenzy 形成使狂热的动词后，过去分词 frenzied 转为形容词；拼写 y 变 i 再加 -ed。',FRENZY+[['英语 frenzy〔动词〕→ frenzied〔分词形容词〕','使进入狂热状态 → 充满狂热或忙乱的']],'frenzied activity 是疯狂忙乱的活动；frenzied bidding 是激烈抢拍。它比 simply active 强烈得多，往往含不受控制的感觉。','frenzied activity；frenzied bidding；a frenzied crowd；frenzied preparations。','frenzy 是状态名词；frenzied 常放在名词前描述这种状态。不要写成 a frenzy crowd。',('The final minutes of the auction brought frenzied bidding.','拍卖最后几分钟出现了疯狂竞价。'),('We arrived in the middle of frenzied preparations for the festival.','我们到达时，大家正为节日忙得团团转。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/frenzied','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/frenzied']),
E('frenetic','/frəˈnetɪk/','忙乱而狂热的；节奏极快的','动作接着动作，几乎没有停顿，整个场景像被不断加速。','经古法语 frenetike、拉丁 phreneticus 接希腊 phrenitikos；这个完整借词与 frantic 的中古英语短变体分开发展。',FRENETIC,'a frenetic pace 是快得忙乱的节奏；frenetic activity 是密集而躁动的活动。它既可形容城市工作，也可形容音乐或舞台风格。','a frenetic pace；frenetic activity；frenetic energy；a frenetic performance。','frantic 更常带焦虑、担忧；frenetic 更常描写不停歇的速度与能量，两者有重叠。',('The newsroom operated at a frenetic pace on election night.','选举之夜，新闻编辑室以忙乱的快节奏运转。'),('The film opens with a frenetic chase through the market.','电影开场是一段穿过市场的疯狂追逐。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/frenetic','https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/frenetic#English']),
E('frenetically','/frəˈnetɪkli/','忙乱而飞快地；狂热地','把 frenetic 的密集节奏放到具体动作上，看得见不停运动的样子。','frenetic + -ally；-ically 的常见读法为 /ɪkli/，重音仍在 net。',FRENETIC+[['英语 frenetic + -ally → frenetically','以忙乱而快速的方式行动']],'move frenetically 是忙乱地快速移动；work frenetically 是飞快忙碌地工作。语气常比 rapidly 更有画面感。','move frenetically；work frenetically；dance frenetically。','rapidly 中性地强调快；frenetically 常同时带高强度、躁动或缺少条理。',('Stagehands moved frenetically between the sets.','舞台工作人员在各组布景之间忙乱地来回穿梭。'),('The dancers spun frenetically as the music accelerated.','音乐越来越快，舞者们也飞快地旋转起来。'),sources=['https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/frenetically','https://www.etymonline.com/word/frenetic']),
E('schizophrenia','英 /ˌskɪtsəˈfriːniə/；美也读 /ˌskɪtsəˈfreniə/','精神分裂症','一种影响思维、感知、情绪和行为的精神疾病，名字里的分裂不能直接理解成有几个人格。','德语 Schizophrenie 用希腊 schizo- 分开与 phrēn 心智造词，再借入英语；这是近代医学命名。',SCHIZ,'症状可涉及幻觉、妄想、思维紊乱，也可能影响动力与认知；不同人的表现不同。词源反映历史命名思路，现代含义应以疾病概念理解。','a diagnosis of schizophrenia；people with schizophrenia；research into schizophrenia。','schizophrenia 不是 dissociative identity disorder，也就是过去常被叫作多重人格的疾病。日常前后矛盾更宜用 inconsistent。',('The documentary follows people living with schizophrenia.','这部纪录片关注精神分裂症患者的日常生活。'),('The research team is studying cognition in schizophrenia.','这个研究团队正在研究精神分裂症中的认知问题。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/schizophrenia','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/schizophrenia','https://www.nimh.nih.gov/health/publications/schizophrenia']),
E('schizophrenic','/ˌskɪtsəˈfrenɪk/','精神分裂症的；患精神分裂症的','它把某些症状或相关问题与精神分裂症联系起来。','schizophrenia 的 schizophren- 词干 + -ic；病名词尾 -ia 不保留。',SCHIZ+[['英语 schizophren- + -ic → schizophrenic','病名对应的形容词；也曾转作称人的名词']],'schizophrenic symptoms 是精神分裂症相关症状。旧文也会用 a schizophrenic 称患者，现代叙述常写 a person with schizophrenia；把它随意比喻反复无常，容易混淆病义。','schizophrenic symptoms；a schizophrenic disorder；the term schizophrenic。','schizophrenia 是疾病名，schizophrenic 是相关形容词。它不等于 split personality，也不等于性格多变。',('The paper examines how schizophrenic symptoms are described in clinical interviews.','这篇论文研究临床访谈如何描述精神分裂症相关症状。'),('The editor replaced “schizophrenic” with “inconsistent” in the description of the policy.','编辑把形容政策的“精神分裂式”改成了“前后不一致”。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/schizophrenia','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/schizophrenic_1','https://www.nimh.nih.gov/health/publications/schizophrenia']),
]
